        <mxCell id="schedule-2" value="&lt;div style='font-size:19px;font-weight:bold'&gt;Voice 계산&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;다음 음성 chunk 처리&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:15px;color:#526178'&gt;출력 중 새 발화면 generation 취소&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=rectangle;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3ECFF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#172033;dashed=0;arcSize=14;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
